<title>ITALY: Gross yield unch at 6.45 pct on 3-mo Italian BOTs.</title>
<headline>Gross yield unch at 6.45 pct on 3-mo Italian BOTs.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 12.5 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.45	(6.45)    98.40	  (98.40)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.39	(6.40)    96.88	  (96.89)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.33	(6.33)    94.05	  (94.05)</p>
<p>Note: results compare with a previous auction on June 25.</p>
</text>
